"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, the_werecleaner.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. MelonLoader will then be installed into the game's core folder. The AP Mod folder will be placed inside 'Mods'.\nOnly the Mods folder will be created automatically, the other ones will be created after starting the game.",
