"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is set up, a new 'Archipelago' window should appear in the top-left corner of the main menu.\n\nIn the 'Address:port' field, enter archipelago.gg: followed by the port. This is a 5-digit number that you can find on the website after creating a new room.\n\nThe 'Password' field is optional. If the host did not set one, leave it blank.\n\nIn 'Slot', enter the name assigned to your YAML file.\n\nFinally, click 'Connect' and start a new run!",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Revert Infos",
